<title>FRANCE: EU to hold Feb 25 wheat aid tender to Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>EU to hold Feb 25 wheat aid tender to Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will hold a tender on February 25 to supply 45,000 tonnes of EU soft wheat as food aid to Bangladesh, France's grain office ONIC said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU will hold another tender on the same day to supply Ivory Coast with 2,480 tonnes of EU maize flour as food aid, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
